ns\">`\n- Line 231: `</div>` (closes as-entry-actions) - Wait, I don't see this!\n\nAh, here's the issue! We're missing the closing tag for the as-entry-actions div. Let me add it.\n\nActually, looking again:\nLine 227: `<div className=\"as-entry-actions\">`\nLine 230 should be the closing tag for this div, but it's missing.\n\nSo we need to add `</div>` before the closing of the as-entry-head div.\n\nLet me fix this:\n", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-828eb537ce4953fc", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "Edit", "arguments": "{\"replace_all\": false, \"file_path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\01ker\\\\ArbiterCoffeeHUB\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\pages\\\\admin\\\\AdminSettings.jsx\", \"old_string\": \"                          <div className=\\\"as-entry-actions\\\">\\n                            <button className=\\\"as-icon-btn\\\" title=\\\"Edit\\\" onClick={() => openTmEdit(m)}><FaEdit /></button>\\n                            <button className=\\\"as-icon-btn danger\\\" title=\\\"Remove\\\" onClick={() => deleteTm(m)}><FaTrash /></button>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        {m.bio && (\\n                          <div className=\\\"as-entry-body\\\">\\n                            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontSize: '.875rem', color: '#6b7280' }}>{m.bio}</p>\\n                          </div>\\n                        )}\\n                      </div>\\n                    ))}\", \"new_string\": \"                          <div className=\\\"as-entry-actions\\\">\\n                            <button className=\\\"as-icon-btn\\\" title=\\\"Edit\\\" onClick={() => openTmEdit(m)}><FaEdit /></button>\\n                            <button className=\\\"as-icon-btn danger\\\" title=\\\"Remove\\\" onClick={() => deleteTm(m)}><FaTrash /></button>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        {m.bio && (\\n                          <div className=\\\"as-entry-body\\\">\\n 