ssName=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">   <!-- team column -->\n\nThis is still two adjacent div elements (with a comment in between) at the same level (inside the as-section-row). And that is allowed because they are both children of the as-section-row.\n\nBut wait, the error is saying that we have adjacent JSX elements that are not wrapped. However, note that the as-section-row div is the parent, so the two columns are not at the top level of the return statement. They are inside the as-section-row div.\n\nUnless... the as-section-row div is not properly closed? Let's check:\n\nWe see the as-section-row div opened at line 133: <div className=\"as-section-row row g-4\">\nAnd then we see it closed at line 242: </div>\n\nBut note that between the opening and closing, we have the two columns and the comment. So the as-section-row div is the parent of the two columns.\n\nHowever, the error is occurring at line 240, which is inside the team column. Let me look at the team column's content again.\n\nWe see that the team column div is opened at line 189, and then we have:\n\n190:            <ResponsiveCard className=\"as-section-card\">\n...\n240:              </ResponsiveCard>\n241:          </div>   <!-- This closes the team column div -->\n\nSo the team column div is closed at line 241, and then we have:\n\n242:        </div>   <!-- This closes the as-section-row div -->\n243:      </div>   <!-- This closes the as-page div -->\n244:    </PageShell>   <!-- This closes the PageShell -->\n\nSo the structure seems correct.\n\nBut wait, the error is at line 240:14, which is the closing tag of the ResponsiveCard inside the team column. The error says \"Adjacent JSX elements must be wrapped in an enclosing tag\". This error is being triggered by the ResponsiveCard's closing tag? That doesn't make sense.\n\nPerhaps the issue is that inside the team column's ResponsiveCard, we have adjacent JSX elements? Let's look at the content of the team column's ResponsiveCard.\n\nWe have:\n\n190:    