the as-entries div. Then we close the as-section-body div at line 241? Let's see:\n\n204:              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n205:                <ResponsiveAlert ... />\n206:                {loading.team ? (...) : team.length === 0 ? (...) : (...) }\n207:              </div>   <!-- This is line 241? -->\n\nWait, we have to count the lines. Let me try to reconstruct the team member section from the file we have.\n\nAlternatively, note that the error might be because we have two adjacent elements in the as-section-body: the ResponsiveAlert and the ternary expression. But that is not allowed because they are two siblings without a wrapper.\n\nLook at lines 204-207:\n\n              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n                <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.team?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('team')} message={alert.team?.msg} type={alert.team?.type} />\n                {loading.team ? (...) : team.length === 0 ? (...) : (...) }\n              </div>\n\nHere, inside the as-section-body div, we have two elements:\n1. <ResponsiveAlert ... />\n2. {loading.team ? (...) : team.length === 0 ? (...) : (...) }\n\nThese are two adjacent JSX elements (a component and a ternary expression that returns JSX) without being wrapped in a single parent. That is the cause of the error!\n\nWe must wrap the contents of the as-section-body div in a single parent, or use a fragment, or put them in a div.\n\nSimilarly, the same issue might exist in the timeline section.\n\nLet's fix the timeline section first and then the team section.\n\nFor the timeline section, the as-section-body is:\n\n              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n                <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.timeline?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('timeline')} message={alert.timeline?.msg} type={alert.timeline?.type} />\n                {loading.timeline ? (...) : timeline.length === 0 ? (...) : (...) }\n              </div>\n\nWe have the same issue: two adjacent elements (the alert and the ternary) inside the as-section-body div.\n\nWe can fix both by wrapping the two elements in a div, or by using a fragment. Since we are already in a div, we can just wrap them in another div, but that might add unnecessary nesting. Alternatively, we can use a fragment <>...</>.\n\nHowever, note that the as-section-body div is already there. We can change it to:\n\n              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n                <>\n                  <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.timeline?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('timeline')} message={alert.timeline?.msg} type={alert.timeline?.type} />\n                  {loading.timeline ? (...) : timeline.length === 0 ? (...) : (...) }\n                </>\n              </div>\n\nBut note: the alert and the ternary are two elements, so we need to wrap them.\n\nAlternatively, we can put them in a div, but that would add an extra div. Since we are already in a div (the as-section-body), we can just remove the as-section-body div and put the two elements directly? But then we lose the class and the structure.\n\nAlternatively, we can keep the as-section-body div and put the two elements inside a fragment.\n\nLet's do that for both sections.\n\nBut note: the error is occurring in the AdminSettings.jsx file, and we are currently looking at the team section. However, the timeline section might have the same issue and might cause an error after we fix the team section.\n\nLet's fix the team section first.\n\nWe'll change the as-section-body of the team member card from:\n\n              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n                <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.team?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('team')} message={alert.team?.msg} type={alert.team?.type} />\n                {loading.team ? (\n                  <div className=\"as-loading\"><div className=\"as-spinner\" />Loading team members\u2026</div>\n                ) : team.length === 0 ? (\n                  <div className=\"as-empty\">\n                    <div className=\"as-empty-icon\"><FaUsers /></div>\n                    <div className=\"as-empty-text\">No team members yet</div>\n                    <div className=\"as-empty-sub\">Add members to display on your public page</div>\n                  </div>\n                ) : (\n                  <div className=\"as-entries\">\n                    {team.map((m, idx) => (\n                      <div className=\"as-entry-card\" key={m.id || idx}>\n                        ... \n                      </div>\n                    ))}\n                  </div>\n                )}\n              </div>\n\nto:\n\n              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n                <>\n                  <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.team?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('team')} message={alert.team?.msg} type={alert.team?.type} />\n                  {loading.team ? (\n                    <div className=\"as-loading\"><div className=\"as-spinner\" />Loading team members\u2026</div>\n                  ) : team.length === 0 ? (\n                    <div className=\"as-empty\">\n                      <div className=\"as-empty-icon\"><FaUsers /></div>\n                      <div className=\"as-empty-text\">No team members yet</div>\n                      <div className=\"as-empty-sub\">Add members to display on your public page</div>\n                    </div>\n                  ) : (\n                    <div className=\"as-entries\">\n                      {team.map((m, idx) => (\n                        <div className=\"as-entry-card\" key={m.id || idx}>\n                          ... \n                        </div>\n                      ))}\n                    </div>\n                  )}\n                </>\n              </div>\n\nSimilarly for the timeline section.\n\nLet's make these changes.\n\nFirst, let's fix the team section (since the error is pointing to that area, but note the error is at line 240 which is the closing of the ResponsiveCard, but the actual problem is the two adjacent elements in the as-section-body).\n\nWe'll edit the file accordingly.\n\nHowever, note that the error message for the build said the error was at line 240:14, which is the closing tag of the ResponsiveCard. But after we fix the two adjacent elements, the error should go away.\n\nLet's do the change for the team section first.\n\nWe'll read the current team section and then make the change.\n\nBut note: we are in the middle of the file. We'll do an Edit from line 204 to line 241 (the as-section-body div and its contents) and replace it with the fixed version.\n\nAlternatively, we can do two separate edits: one for the timeline section and one for the team section.\n\nLet's do the timeline section first, then the team section.\n\nFirst, timeline section:\n\nWe need to change the as-section-body of the timeline card (lines 150-183 in the current file?).\n\nLet me look at the timeline section in the current file:\n\n150:              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n151:                <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.timeline?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('timeline')} message={alert.timeline?.msg} type={alert.timeline?.type} />\n152:                {loading.timeline ? (\n153:                  <div className=\"as-loading\"><div className=\"as-spinner\" />Loading timeline\u2026</div>\n154:                ) : timeline.length === 0 ? (\n155:                  <div className=\"as-empty\">\n156:                    <div className=\"as-empty-icon\"><FaHistory /></div>\n157:                    <div className=\"as-empty-text\">No timeline entries yet</div>\n                    <div className=\"as-empty-sub\">Add your first milestone to showcase your journey</div>\n                  </div>\n                ) : (\n                  <div className=\"as-entries\">\n                    {timeline.map((item, idx) => (\n                      <div className=\"as-entry-card\" key={item.id || idx}>\n                        ... \n                      </div>\n                    ))}\n                  </div>\n                )}\n183:              </div>\n\nWe'll change lines 150-183 to:\n\n              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n                <>\n                  <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.timeline?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('timeline')} message={alert.timeline?.msg} type={alert.timeline?.type} />\n                  {loading.timeline ? (\n                    <div className=\"as-loading\"><div className=\"as-spinner\" />Loading timeline\u2026</div>\n                  ) : timeline.length === 0 ? (\n                    <div className=\"as-empty\">\n                      <div className=\"as-empty-icon\"><FaHistory /></div>\n                      <div className=\"as-empty-text\">No timeline entries yet</div>\n                      <div className=\"as-empty-sub\">Add your first milestone to showcase your journey</div>\n                    </div>\n                  ) : (\n                    <div className=\"as-entries\">\n                      {timeline.map((item, idx) => (\n                        <div className=\"as-entry-card\" key={item.id || idx}>\n                          ... \n                        </div>\n                      ))}\n                    </div>\n                  )}\n                </>\n              </div>\n\nNow, let's do the same for the team section.\n\nBut note: we have already made a change to the RegisterPage.jsx. Now we are going to change AdminSettings.jsx.\n\nLet's do the timeline section first.\n\nWe'll use the Edit tool to replace the as-section-body of the timeline card.\n\nWe need to capture the exact string from line 150 to line 183 (inclusive) and replace it.\n\nBut note: the line numbers might have changed since we last read the file? We have the current content in our context from the last Read.\n\nWe'll do:\n\n  Read the file again to get the current content, then replace the timeline section's as-section-body.\n\nBut to be safe, let's read the file again and then do the edit.\n\nHowever, note that we are in a loop and the file might have been changed by our previous edits? We only changed RegisterPage.jsx, so AdminSettings.jsx is unchanged.\n\nLet's read AdminSettings.jsx again and then do the edit for the timeline section.\n\n", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-b5ef1d36d151914e", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "Read", "arguments": "{\"file_path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\01ker\\\\ArbiterCoffeeHUB\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\pages\\\\admin\\\\AdminSettings.jsx\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b5ef1d36d151914e", "content": "1\timport React, { useEffect, useState, useCallback } from 'react';\n2\timport { ResponsiveButton, ResponsiveForm, ResponsiveModal, ResponsiveAlert, ResponsiveCard } from '@/components/responsive';\n3\timport {\n4\t  FaHistory, FaUsers, FaPlus, FaEdit, FaTrash, FaTimes,\n5\t  FaChevronUp, FaChevronDown, FaSave, FaUserCircle, FaSync,\n6\t} from 'react-icons/fa';\n7\timport apiService from '../../services/api.service';\n8\timport { API_ENDPOINTS } from '../../config/api';\n9\timport PageShell from '../../components/layout/PageShell';\n10\timport './AdminSettings.css';\n11\t\n12\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500 Blank helpers \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n13\tconst blankTimeline = () => ({ year: new Date().getFullYear(), title: '', description: '' });\n14\tconst blankMember   = () => ({ name: '', role: '', bio: '', photo_url: '', display_order: 0 });\n15\t\n16\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500 Alert banner \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n17\tconst Alert = ({ msg, type, onClose }) =>\n18\t  msg ? (\n19\t    <div className={`as-alert ${type}`}>\n20\t      {msg}\n21\t      <button className=\"as-alert-close\" onClick={onClose}><FaTimes /></button>\n22\t    </div>\n23\t  ) : null;\n24\t\n25\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500 Main Component \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n26\tconst AdminSettings = () => {\n27\t  const [timeline, setTimeline]   = useState([]);\n28\t  const [team, setTeam]           = useState([]);\n29\t  const [loading, setLoading]     = useState({ timeline: true, team: true });\n30\t  const [saving, setSaving]       = useState({ timeline: false, team: false });\n31\t  const [alert, setAlert]         = useState({ timeline: null, team: null });\n32\t  const [error, setError]         = useState(null);\n33\t\n34\t  // Modal state shared\n35\t  const [tlModal, setTlModal]     = useState(false);\n36\t  const [tmModal, setTmModal]     = useState(false);\n37\t  const [selected, setSelected]   = useState(null);\n38\t  const [tlForm, setTlForm]       = useState(blankTimeline());\n39\t  const [tmForm, setTmForm]       = useState(blankMember());\n40\t\n41\t  const clearAlert = (key) => setAlert(p => ({ ...p, [key]: null }));\n42\t  const showAlert = (key, msg, type = 'success') => {\n43\t    setAlert(p => ({ ...p, [key]: { msg, type } }));\n44\t    setTimeout(() => clearAlert(key), 4000);\n45\t  };\n46\t\n47\t  // \u2500\u2500 Fetch Timeline \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n48\t  const fetchTimeline = useCallback(async () => {\n49\t    setLoading(p => ({ ...p, timeline: true }));\n50\t    try {\n51\t      const res = await apiService.get(API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TIMELINE);\n52\t      if (res.success) setTimeline(Array.isArray(res.data) ? res.data : (res.data?.data || []));\n53\t    } catch { setError('Failed to load timeline.'); }\n54\t    finally { setLoading(p => ({ ...p, timeline: false })); }\n55\t  }, []);\n56\t\n57\t  // \u2500\u2500 Fetch Team \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n58\t  const fetchTeam = useCallback(async () => {\n59\t    setLoading(p => ({ ...p, team: true }));\n60\t    try {\n61\t      const res = await apiService.get(API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TEAM);\n62\t      if (res.success) setTeam(Array.isArray(res.data) ? res.data : (res.data?.data || []));\n63\t    } catch { setError('Failed to load team members.'); }\n64\t    finally { setLoading(p => ({ ...p, team: false })); }\n65\t  }, []);\n66\t\n67\t  useEffect(() => { fetchTimeline(); fetchTeam(); }, [fetchTimeline, fetchTeam]);\n68\t\n69\t  // \u2500\u2500 Timeline CRUD \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n70\t  const openTlAdd  = () => { setSelected(null); setTlForm(blankTimeline()); setTlModal(true); };\n71\t  const openTlEdit = (item) => { setSelected(item); setTlForm({ year: item.year || '', title: item.title || '', description: item.description || '' }); setTlModal(true); };\n72\t\n73\t  const saveTl = async (e) => {\n74\t    e.preventDefault();\n75\t    setSaving(p => ({ ...p, timeline: true }));\n76\t    try {\n77\t      const res = selected\n78\t        ? await apiService.put(`${API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TIMELINE}/${selected.id}`, tlForm)\n79\t        : await apiService.post(API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TIMELINE, tlForm);\n80\t      if (res.success) { setTlModal(false); fetchTimeline(); showAlert('timeline', selected ? 'Timeline entry updated.' : 'Timeline entry added.'); }\n81\t      else showAlert('timeline', res.message || 'Save failed.', 'danger');\n82\t    } catch { showAlert('timeline', 'Failed to save timeline entry.', 'danger'); }\n83\t    finally { setSaving(p => ({ ...p, timeline: false })); }\n84\t  };\n85\t\n86\t  const deleteTl = async (item) => {\n87\t    if (!window.confirm(`Delete \"${item.title}\" (${item.year})?`)) return;\n88\t    try {\n89\t      await apiService.delete(`${API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TIMELINE}/${item.id}`);\n90\t      fetchTimeline(); showAlert('timeline', 'Entry deleted.');\n91\t    } catch { showAlert('timeline', 'Delete failed.', 'danger'); }\n92\t  };\n93\t\n94\t  const moveTl = (idx, dir) => {\n95\t    const arr = [...timeline];\n96\t    const target = idx + dir;\n97\t    if (target < 0 || target >= arr.length) return;\n98\t    [arr[idx], arr[target]] = [arr[target], arr[idx]];\n99\t    setTimeline(arr);\n100\t  };\n101\t\n102\t  // \u2500\u2500 Team CRUD \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n103\t  const openTmAdd  = () => { setSelected(null); setTmForm(blankMember()); setTmModal(true); };\n104\t  const openTmEdit = (m) => { setSelected(m); setTmForm({ name: m.name || '', role: m.role || '', bio: m.bio || '', photo_url: m.photo_url || '', display_order: m.display_order || 0 }); setTmModal(true); };\n105\t\n106\t  const saveTm = async (e) => {\n107\t    e.preventDefault();\n108\t    setSaving(p => ({ ...p, team: true }));\n109\t    try {\n110\t      const res = selected\n111\t        ? await apiService.put(`${API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TEAM}/${selected.id}`, tmForm)\n112\t        : await apiService.post(API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TEAM, tmForm);\n113\t      if (res.success) { setTmModal(false); fetchTeam(); showAlert('team', selected ? 'Member updated.' : 'Member added.'); }\n114\t      else showAlert('team', res.message || 'Save failed.', 'danger');\n115\t    } catch { showAlert('team', 'Failed to save team member.', 'danger'); }\n116\t    finally { setSaving(p => ({ ...p, team: false })); }\n117\t  };\n118\t\n119\t  const deleteTm = async (m) => {\n120\t    if (!window.confirm(`Remove team member \"${m.name}\"?`)) return;\n121\t    try {\n122\t      await apiService.delete(`${API_ENDPOINTS.ADMIN.SETTINGS.TEAM}/${m.id}`);\n123\t      fetchTeam(); showAlert('team', 'Member removed.');\n124\t    } catch { showAlert('team', 'Delete failed.', 'danger'); }\n125\t  };\n126\t\n127\t  const tlField = k => ({ value: tlForm[k], onChange: e => setTlForm(p => ({ ...p, [k]: e.target.value })) });\n128\t  const tmField = k => ({ value: tmForm[k], onChange: e => setTmForm(p => ({ ...p, [k]: e.target.value })) });\n129\t\n130\t  return (\n131\t    <PageShell title=\"Settings\" subtitle=\"Manage company timeline and team members\" error={error} onRetry={() => { fetchTimeline(); fetchTeam(); }}>\n132\t      <div className=\"as-page\">\n133\t        <div className=\"as-section-row row g-4\">\n134\t          {/* \u2500\u2500 Company Timeline \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */}\n135\t          <div className=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">\n136\t            <ResponsiveCard className=\"as-section-card\">\n137\t              <div className=\"as-section-head\">\n138\t                <div className=\"as-section-icon green\"><FaHistory /></div>\n139\t                <span className=\"as-section-title\">Company Timeline</span>\n140\t                <span className=\"as-section-count\">{timeline.length} entries</span>\n141\t                <div className=\"as-head-actions\">\n142\t                  <ResponsiveButton variant=\"outline-secondary\" size=\"sm\" className=\"as-btn add\" onClick={fetchTimeline} title=\"Refresh\">\n143\t                    <FaSync />\n144\t                  </ResponsiveButton>\n145\t                  <ResponsiveButton variant=\"primary\" size=\"sm\" className=\"as-btn add\" onClick={openTlAdd}>\n146\t                    <FaPlus />Add Entry\n147\t                  </ResponsiveButton>\n148\t                </div>\n149\t              </div>\n150\t              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n151\t                <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.timeline?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('timeline')} message={alert.timeline?.msg} type={alert.timeline?.type} />\n152\t                {loading.timeline ? (\n153\t                  <div className=\"as-loading\"><div className=\"as-spinner\" />Loading timeline\u2026</div>\n154\t                ) : timeline.length === 0 ? (\n155\t                  <div className=\"as-empty\">\n156\t                    <div className=\"as-empty-icon\"><FaHistory /></div>\n157\t                    <div className=\"as-empty-text\">No timeline entries yet</div>\n158\t                    <div className=\"as-empty-sub\">Add your first milestone to showcase your journey</div>\n159\t                  </div>\n160\t                ) : (\n161\t                  <div className=\"as-entries\">\n162\t                    {timeline.map((item, idx) => (\n163\t                      <div className=\"as-entry-card\" key={item.id || idx}>\n164\t                        <div className=\"as-entry-head\">\n165\t                          <div className=\"as-entry-num\">{idx + 1}</div>\n166\t                          <span className=\"as-year-pill\">{item.year}</span>\n167\t                          <span className={`as-entry-title ${item.title ? '' : 'muted'}`}>{item.title || 'Untitled entry'}</span>\n168\t                          <div className=\"as-entry-actions\">\n169\t                            <button className=\"as-icon-btn\" title=\"Move up\"   disabled={idx === 0}                   onClick={() => moveTl(idx, -1)}><FaChevronUp /></button>\n170\t                            <button className=\"as-icon-btn\" title=\"Move down\" disabled={idx === timeline.length - 1} onClick={() => moveTl(idx, +1)}><FaChevronDown /></button>\n171\t                            <button className=\"as-icon-btn\" title=\"Edit\" onClick={() => openTlEdit(item)}><FaEdit /></button>\n172\t                            <button className=\"as-icon-btn danger\" title=\"Delete\" onClick={() => deleteTl(item)}><FaTrash /></button>\n173\t                          </div>\n174\t                        </div>\n175\t                        {item.description && (\n176\t                          <div className=\"as-entry-body\">\n177\t                            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontSize: '.875rem', color: '#6b7280' }}>{item.description}</p>\n178\t                          </div>\n179\t                        )}\n180\t                      </div>\n181\t                    ))}\n182\t                  </div>\n183\t                )}\n184\t              </div>\n185\t            </ResponsiveCard>\n186\t          </div>\n187\t\n188\t          {/* \u2500\u2500 Team Members \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */}\n189\t          <div className=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">\n190\t            <ResponsiveCard className=\"as-section-card\">\n191\t              <div className=\"as-section-head\">\n192\t                <div className=\"as-section-icon blue\"><FaUsers /></div>\n193\t                <span className=\"as-section-title\">Team Members</span>\n194\t                <span className=\"as-section-count\">{team.length} members</span>\n195\t                <div className=\"as-head-actions\">\n196\t                  <ResponsiveButton variant=\"outline-secondary\" size=\"sm\" className=\"as-btn add\" onClick={fetchTeam} title=\"Refresh\">\n197\t                    <FaSync />\n198\t                  </ResponsiveButton>\n199\t                  <ResponsiveButton variant=\"primary\" size=\"sm\" className=\"as-btn add\" onClick={openTmAdd}>\n200\t                    <FaPlus />Add Member\n201\t                  </ResponsiveButton>\n202\t                </div>\n203\t              </div>\n204\t              <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n205\t                <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.team?.msg} onHide={() => clearAlert('team')} message={alert.team?.msg} type={alert.team?.type} />\n206\t                {loading.team ? (\n207\t                  <div className=\"as-loading\"><div className=\"as-spinner\" />Loading team members\u2026</div>\n208\t                ) : team.length === 0 ? (\n209\t                  <div className=\"as-empty\">\n210\t                    <div className=\"as-empty-icon\"><FaUsers /></div>\n211\t                    <div className=\"as-empty-text\">No team members yet</div>\n212\t                    <div className=\"as-empty-sub\">Add members to display on your public page</div>\n213\t                  </div>\n214\t                ) : (\n215\t                  <div className=\"as-entries\">\n216\t                    {team.map((m, idx) => (\n217\t                      <div className=\"as-entry-card\" key={m.id || idx}>\n218\t                        <div className=\"as-entry-head\">\n219\t                          <div className=\"as-entry-num\">{idx + 1}</div>\n220\t                          {m.photo_url\n221\t                            ? <img className=\"as-avatar-preview\" src={m.photo_url} alt={m.name} loading=\"lazy\" style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: '50%', objectFit: 'cover' }} />\n222\t                            : <div className=\"as-avatar-placeholder\" style={{ width: 32, height: 32, fontSize: '.9rem' }}><FaUserCircle /></div>}\n223\t                          <span className={`as-entry-title ${m.name ? '' : 'muted'}`}>\n224\t                            {m.name || 'Unnamed'}\n225\t                            {m.role && <span style={{ fontWeight: 400, color: '#9ca3af', marginLeft: '.4rem', fontSize: '.8rem' }}>\u2014 {m.role}</span>}\n226\t                          </span>\n227\t                          <div className=\"as-entry-actions\">\n228\t                            <button className=\"as-icon-btn\" title=\"Edit\" onClick={() => openTmEdit(m)}><FaEdit /></button>\n229\t                            <button className=\"as-icon-btn danger\" title=\"Remove\" onClick={() => deleteTm(m)}><FaTrash /></button>\n230\t                          </div>\n231\t                        </div>\n232\t                        {m.bio && (\n233\t                          <div className=\"as-entry-body\">\n234\t                            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontSize: '.875rem', color: '#6b7280' }}>{m.bio}</p>\n235\t                