(closes as-page)\n\nAh! I see the issue now. The closing tags are mismatched. We have:\n\n1. Line 239: Closes the `as-entries` div\n2. Line 240: Should close the `as-section-body` div, but instead closes the `ResponsiveCard`  \n3. Line 241: Should close the `ResponsiveCard`, but instead closes the `as-section-body` div\n4. Line 242: Should close the Team Members column div, but instead closes the as-section-row div\n5. Line 243: Should close the as-section-row div, but instead closes the as-page div\n6. Line 244: Should close the as-page div, but instead closes the PageShell\n\nThe problem is that the closing `</ResponsiveCard>` tag is in the wrong place. It should come after the closing `</div>` for the as-section-body, not before it.\n\nLooking at the structure, it should be:\n```\n                  <div className=\"as-entries\">\n                    {team.map(...)}\n                  </div>\n                </div>  <!-- as-section-body -->\n              </ResponsiveCard>\n            </div>  <!-- Team Members column -->\n          </div>  <!-- as-section-row -->\n        </div>  <!-- as-page -->\n      </PageShell>\n```\n\nBut we have:\n```\n                  <div className=\"as-entries\">\n                    {team.map(...)}\n                  </div>\n              </ResponsiveCard>  <!-- WRONG PLACE -->\n            </div>  <!-- This is actually closing as-section-body -->\n          </div>  <!-- This is actually closing Team Members column -->\n        </div>  <!-- This is actually closing as-section-row -->\n      </PageShell>  <!-- This is actually closing as-page -->\n```\n\nSo the `</ResponsiveCard>` on line 240 is in the wrong place. It should be moved down to after the `</div>` that closes the as-section-body.\n\nLet me find where the as-section-body opening tag is to confirm the structure.\n\nLooking backwards from line 239:\n```\n204                <div className=\"as-section-body\">\n205                  <ResponsiveAlert show={!!alert.team?.msg} onHi