e trace this:\n\nFrom line 239-245:\n```\n              </ResponsiveCard>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </PageShell>\n```\n\nThis suggests that after the Team Members ResponsiveCard closes, we have:\n1. `</div>` (line 240) - closes the Team Members column\n2. `</div>` (line 241) - closes the as-section-row  \n3. `</div>` (line 242) - closes the as-page\n4. `</PageShell>` (line 243-244)\n\nBut looking at the opening structure, we should have:\n1. `<PageShell>` \n2. `<div className=\"as-page\">`\n3. `<div className=\"as-section-row row g-4\">`\n4. `<div className=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">` (Timeline column)\n5. `<ResponsiveCard className=\"as-section-card\">` (Timeline card)\n6. ... timeline content ...\n7. `</ResponsiveCard>` (end Timeline card)\n8. `</div>` (end Timeline column)\n9. `<div className=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">` (Team Members column) \n10. `<ResponsiveCard className=\"as-section-card\">` (Team Members card)\n11. ... team members content ...\n12. `</ResponsiveCard>` (end Team Members card)\n13. `</div>` (end Team Members column)\n14. `</div>` (end as-section-row)\n15. `</div>` (end as-page)\n16. `</PageShell>`\n\nSo we're missing the opening `<div className=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">` for the Team Members column! Let me check where that should be.\n\nLooking at lines 188-189:\n```\n          {/* \u2500\u2500 Team Members \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */}\n          <div className=\"col-12 col-sm-6\">\n```\n\nAh, there it is! So the Team Members column opens at line 189. Then the ResponsiveCard opens at line 190. The content goes through, and then at the end we should close the ResponsiveCard, then close the column div.\n\nBut looking at the end of the file, after the 